{"t":"LVS","n":"Las Vegas Sands Corp.","nKo":"라스베거스 샌즈","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":39.14,"chg":0.29,"chgPct":0.00746,"prev":38.85,"dayH":39.49,"dayL":38.87,"w52H":70.45,"w52L":35.03,"vol":5143022,"avgVol":5704890,"mcap":24540393472,"pe":16.04,"fpe":12.77,"eps":2.44,"feps":3.07,"pb":null,"div":1.2,"divY":0.0307,"beta":0.75,"short":19749390,"shortPct":0.1855,"shortRatio":3.08,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Consumer Cyclical","sKo":"소비자 경기순환","i":"Resorts & Casinos","iKo":"리조트 및 카지노","city":"Las Vegas","emp":41000,"web":"https://www.sands.com","sum":"Las Vegas Sands Corp., together with its subsidiaries, owns, develops, and operates integrated resorts in Macao and Singapore. It owns and operates The Venetian Macao Resort Hotel, The Londoner Macao, The Parisian Macao, The Plaza Macao and Four Seasons Hotel Macao, and The Sands Macao in Macao, the People's Republic of China; and Marina Bay Sands in Singapore. The company's integrated resorts feature accommodations, gaming, entertainment and retail malls, convention and exhibition facilities, celebrity chef restaurants, and other amenities. The company was founded in 1988 and is based in Las Vegas, Nevada.","sumKo":"Las Vegas Sands Corp.는 자회사와 함께 마카오와 싱가포르에서 통합 리조트를 소유, 개발 및 운영합니다. 이 회사는 중화인민공화국 마카오에 있는 The Venetian Macao Resort Hotel, The Londoner Macao, The Parisian Macao, The Plaza Macao 및 Four Seasons Hotel Macao, The Sands Macao를 소유하고 운영합니다. 싱가포르의 마리나 베이 샌즈. 회사의 통합 리조트에는 숙박 시설, 게임, 엔터테인먼트 및 소매 쇼핑몰, 컨벤션 및 전시 시설, 유명 셰프 레스토랑 및 기타 편의 시설이 있습니다. 이 회사는 1988년에 설립되었으며 네바다주 라스베가스에 본사를 두고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":4110000000,"ni":1832000000},{"y":2023,"rev":10372000000,"ni":1221000000},{"y":2024,"rev":11298000000,"ni":1446000000},{"y":2025,"rev":13017000000,"ni":1627000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":3649000000,"ni":395000000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":3585000000,"ni":567000000},{"q":"2Q2026","rev":3154000000,"ni":346000000},{"q":"3Q2026","rev":3216000000,"ni":304000000}],"eps":[{"q":"4Q2025","act